    "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>We’re</span><span>&nbsp;excited to announce the public preview of the Data API for </span><span>vCore</span><span>-based Azure Cosmos DB for MongoDB. </span><span>The Data</span><span>&nbsp;API provides a flexible and powerful way to interact with your database through HTTP-based API calls.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span><span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/mongodbvcore-data-api-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><br></div>",
